flowchart TD
    Start([Início]) --> Planning[Planejamento]
    Planning --> Analysis[Análise de Requisitos]
    Analysis --> Design[Design e Arquitetura]

    Design --> Development{Desenvolvimento}
    Development --> Frontend[Frontend]
    Development --> Backend[Backend]
    Development --> Database[Database]

    Frontend --> Testing[Testing]
    Backend --> Testing
    Database --> Testing

    Testing --> Review{Code Review}
    Review -->|Aprovações| Deploy[Deploy]
    Review -->|Correções| Development

    Deploy --> Monitoring[Monitoramento]
    Monitoring --> Maintenance[Manutenção]

    Maintenance -->|Novas Features| Planning
    Maintenance -->|Bugs| Analysis

    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style Deploy fill:#87CEEB
    style Testing fill:#FFD700
    style Review fill:#FFA500
